00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:51,000
Shutter is a 2008 American supernatural horror film directed by
Masayuki Ochiai and distributed by 20th Century Fox.

12
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
It was written by Luke Dawson and is a remake of
the 2004 Thai film of the same name.

13
00:55:15,000 --> 00:55:21,000
Its story follows newlywed couple Ben and Jane who have just
moved to Japan for a promising job opportunity.

14
00:59:30,000 --> 00:59:36,000
After a tragic car accident that leads to the death of a young girl, Ben begins noticing strange blurs in many of
his fashion shoot photographs, which Jane suspects is the spirit of the dead girl that they killed.

15
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
The film stars Joshua Jackson, Rachael Taylor, and Megumi Okina.

16
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
It was produced by Regency Enterprises and was released on March 21, 2008.

17
01:12:15,000 --> 01:12:21,000
It grossed $10.4 million in its opening weekend and $48 million worldwide, against an $8 million
budget, making the film a box office success, but was negatively received from critics.

18
